# id|enabled|kind|p1|p2|title|description
# Loaded once at gametype init (server start / map change). Edit then change map.
# kinds: ping_high, victim_streak, revenge, spec_time, suicide, fast_death,
#        kill_then_die, enter_game, stillness, manual
# ping_high: p1=ping threshold, p2=seconds (0 = grant once when crossed, re-arm when below)
lag_lord|1|ping_high|100|60|Lag Lord|Held ping over 100 for 60 seconds
dialup_diplomat|1|ping_high|250|0|Dial-up Diplomat|Ping spiked past 250
punching_bag|1|victim_streak|5|0|Punching Bag|Same player killed you 5 times in a row
the_student|1|revenge|3|0|The Student|Killed the player who got 3 consecutive kills on you
couch_potato|1|spec_time|180|0|Couch Potato|Spectated for 3 minutes
own_goal|1|suicide|1|0|Own Goal Enthusiast|You did that to yourself
spawn_tourist|1|fast_death|5000|0|Spawn Tourist|Died within 5 seconds of spawning
glass_cannon|1|kill_then_die|3000|0|Glass Cannon|Got a kill then died within 3 seconds
frequent_flyer|1|enter_game|0|0|Frequent Flyer|Showed up again
living_statue|1|stillness|30|0|Living Statue|Stood still while alive for 30 seconds
